<title>UK: Cr. Lyonnais sets Casino Guichard warrants.</title>
<headline>Cr. Lyonnais sets Casino Guichard warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants in French francs, in three equal tranches on Casino Guichard-Perrachon, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.SEP.96-06.MAR.98   PAYDATE	27.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  AVERAGE OF SHARE ON PARIS STOCK EXCHANGE ON</p>
<p>		     06.SEP.96.</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		     STRIKE		    ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A	 90 PCT OF REF PRICE    25.59 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> CALL B	 100 PCT OF REF PRICE   18.44 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p> CALL C	 110 PCT OF REF PRICE   14.29 PCT OF REF PRICE</p>
<p>* ** * * *</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
